WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:10.010
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.346
I'm coming.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.558
I'll have more brought out at once.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.105
Everything is in order.

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:28.737
-Bun-hong.
-Yes, madam?

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.280
Where is Mistress Yun?

00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:33.700
Uh. W-Well, she's…

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:53.928
Gentlemen,
your presence here does me honor.

00:01:50.527 --> 00:01:52.320
Why, you're nearly grown up, Won.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:57.408
Thank you, Uncle.
How has your health been?

00:01:57.492 --> 00:02:00.286
Fine. Though, I wish I had some of yours.

00:02:02.664 --> 00:02:08.002
Won, I've prepared a new weasel-hair brush
of black bamboo to present to the elder.

00:02:08.086 --> 00:02:10.713
Would you be so kind
as to fetch it from the study?

00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:14.884
-Well, boy?
-Yes, I'll go at once.

00:03:00.054 --> 00:03:02.473
Sir, this is not a place
a man may enter freely.

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:05.643
I could say the same.

00:03:05.727 --> 00:03:09.355
A woman has no right
to behave this way in my uncle's study.

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:14.444
Oh, it's you. Won.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.529
Cousin Yun?

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:19.657
You've grown into a fine young man.

00:03:19.741 --> 00:03:21.409
I almost didn't recognize you.

00:03:29.417 --> 00:03:31.586
Oh, no! The new brush!

00:03:31.669 --> 00:03:33.713
Uncle asked me to fetch it for him!

00:03:33.796 --> 00:03:35.548
You've already stained the weasel-hair!

00:03:35.632 --> 00:03:38.009
Surely, someone would have
used it before long.

00:03:38.635 --> 00:03:39.802
I don't see the trouble.

00:03:42.805 --> 00:03:46.434
And he was laughing so heartily.
I was taken aback.

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:54.067
-Oh, look, he's brought it back.
-Ah, that's the brush?

00:03:59.489 --> 00:04:01.616
What's this, Won? Did you use the brush?

00:04:01.699 --> 00:04:03.952
How could you have shown such disrespect?

00:04:04.035 --> 00:04:06.788
Won, explain yourself to the elder.

00:04:07.664 --> 00:04:09.916
-Well, you see, I--
-Now, wait just a minute.

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:15.129
Why don't we first have a look
at what young Master Won has written?

00:04:17.465 --> 00:04:21.177
You did write this, didn't you?
Tell us the truth now.

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:23.429
I would like to see it as well.

00:04:23.513 --> 00:04:26.140
My goodness. Brother, look at this.

00:04:26.224 --> 00:04:28.351
Here, read for yourself.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.279
Well now, what a clever lad he is.

00:04:39.362 --> 00:04:41.489
Will you please Explain the merits

00:04:41.572 --> 00:04:44.993
Of the sacred herb from the south
Tobacco?

00:04:45.076 --> 00:04:49.998
The examination hall
Becomes quite a spectacle

00:04:50.873 --> 00:04:52.542
Whose son could he be?

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:55.586
His scholarship is truly exceptional

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.881
Thankfully, I have made
A good living with this pansori

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:01.718
Ha! What else to say?
So I'll sing it for you

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:03.469
As you want me to

00:05:03.553 --> 00:05:06.639
Wishing you'll get to the top

00:05:06.723 --> 00:05:07.807
My lord, if I may.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:10.393
Even if you slip the examiner
A few coins…

00:05:10.476 --> 00:05:13.146
-It isn't much, but still.
-Oh, you shouldn't have.

00:05:13.229 --> 00:05:16.566
Or look around for clues

00:05:16.649 --> 00:05:20.320
A stiff neck
And bad headache you'll get

00:05:20.903 --> 00:05:23.823
Even with a good cheat sheet

00:05:23.906 --> 00:05:26.200
-Take a seat.
-Oh, what's the use?

00:05:26.284 --> 00:05:28.703
This one copies secretly
All the answers

00:05:28.786 --> 00:05:30.705
And this one
Doesn't even bother hiding it

00:05:30.788 --> 00:05:32.665
-That is not true!
-You even copied his name.

00:05:32.749 --> 00:05:35.460
And what about that scholar
With no advantage and no luck?

00:05:35.543 --> 00:05:37.503
-No, it's not what you think.
-You've disgraced yourself.

00:05:37.587 --> 00:05:39.797
There is nothing under heaven
that escapes my notice.

00:05:39.881 --> 00:05:41.966
He is expelled
From the examination hall!

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:44.177
-Faced with an unprecedented question
-Not another word!

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:46.929
The hall falls into confusion

00:05:47.013 --> 00:05:52.643
Such as the graceful crane

00:05:55.563 --> 00:05:58.107
With calm, serene eyes

00:05:58.191 --> 00:06:02.070
A faint smile upon his lips

00:06:03.696 --> 00:06:06.491
Beautiful brushstrokes appear

00:06:06.574 --> 00:06:09.160
Like a black dragon

00:06:09.243 --> 00:06:14.457
Soaring to the sky, so strong

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:19.379
It can reach the blue heavens

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:21.631
Behold!

00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:22.965
He is here

00:06:23.049 --> 00:06:25.551
Yes, he is right here!

00:06:25.635 --> 00:06:29.055
The royal flower gets you at the top

00:06:29.138 --> 00:06:30.139
It's him

00:06:31.015 --> 00:06:34.769
He is right here!

00:06:34.852 --> 00:06:37.647
My worries for you were mountainous,

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:41.150
knowing you had only that taciturn
father of yours to study under.

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:42.443
Tell us, Won,

00:06:42.527 --> 00:06:45.279
surely you must have
at least one literary companion?

00:06:45.363 --> 00:06:49.492
Someone with whom you exchange letters
and share a friendship through words?

00:06:51.828 --> 00:06:53.704
We'll clear the table now, my lord.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:59.085
He's such a clever lad,
I'm sure he has many such friends.

00:06:59.168 --> 00:07:02.463
And if he doesn't,
there's no one to blame, save his father.

00:07:02.547 --> 00:07:05.633
As his father, I humbly apologize.

00:07:08.052 --> 00:07:11.431
His cleverness shone through
the recent initial examination as well.

00:07:13.641 --> 00:07:17.103
Who would have known His Majesty would ask
about the virtues of tobacco?

00:07:17.186 --> 00:07:18.479
Yes, indeed.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:22.316
Won, why don't you share with us
what you wrote?

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:23.985
Recite to us your answer.

00:07:26.696 --> 00:07:30.366
As tobacco's bitter scent
fills my mouth with smoke,

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:34.537
the words I wished to say
can no longer come out,

00:07:35.037 --> 00:07:36.581
and regret fills my heart.

00:07:36.664 --> 00:07:39.208
But before I can give my emotional speech,

00:07:39.292 --> 00:07:41.377
I breathe out smoke instead of words.

00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:42.962
Thus, none may hear me,

00:07:43.045 --> 00:07:45.465
which is the rightful path
of a loyal subject.

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:50.511
It is indeed.
A flawless answer, young man.

00:07:50.595 --> 00:07:55.349
I have no doubt he will achieve top honors
in the palace examination.

00:07:55.433 --> 00:07:59.770
I'm honored, but whatever I achieve
is thanks to my literary friend.

00:07:59.854 --> 00:08:03.649
Shut up, you fool! Why would you attribute
your cleverness to somebody else?

00:08:03.733 --> 00:08:06.068
Besides,
if this literary friend was so great,

00:08:06.152 --> 00:08:08.321
his name would've been well known
long ago.

00:08:12.617 --> 00:08:13.910
You make a good point.

00:08:16.704 --> 00:08:20.082
Have you ever given me the opportunity
to make my name known?

00:08:23.503 --> 00:08:24.962
The elder speaks true.

00:08:26.297 --> 00:08:27.840
One thing's for certain,

00:08:27.924 --> 00:08:31.302
when the boy talks,
he most certainly takes after his father.

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.776
It seems our clan's future
rests on you alone.

00:08:46.859 --> 00:08:48.444
All thanks to you, dear cousin.

00:08:48.528 --> 00:08:53.950
Because of you, I have deeply felt,
and come to know many things.

00:09:12.218 --> 00:09:14.845
Miss Yun, where are you?

00:09:15.346 --> 00:09:17.056
The madam is looking for you!

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:21.185
Please, Won.
You already had plenty of talent.

00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:23.062
I merely showed you the way.

00:09:26.148 --> 00:09:29.235
Did I not tell you to stay
by Yun's side at all times?

00:09:29.735 --> 00:09:31.112
I'm sorry, madam.

00:09:31.195 --> 00:09:33.489
But you know how Miss Yun can disappear.

00:10:32.173 --> 00:10:35.343
Not only are they honored
to be deemed worthy of your clan's seed,

00:10:35.426 --> 00:10:38.054
but when they heard
the bride would be taught to read and draw

00:10:38.137 --> 00:10:39.472
by such a virtuous lady,

00:10:39.555 --> 00:10:41.515
even the mother
was ready to be considered.

00:10:42.058 --> 00:10:46.687
As I told you before, the elder daughter
is gentle and comely like her father.

00:10:47.188 --> 00:10:50.900
The younger takes after her mother
and only really shows a head for trade.

00:10:51.942 --> 00:10:54.236
Therefore,
you only need to look at the elder.

00:11:02.078 --> 00:11:03.954
Silk! Silk for sale!

00:11:06.832 --> 00:11:09.377
-Look! It walks on its hands.
-Oh, my!

00:11:13.589 --> 00:11:15.758
The finest silk from China.

00:11:15.841 --> 00:11:18.719
The highest quality at a lower price.
Come, have a look.

00:11:27.228 --> 00:11:30.022
We are honored
to have you call on us, madam.

00:11:30.523 --> 00:11:33.526
Goodness,
I never thought I'd meet you in person.

00:11:36.404 --> 00:11:38.864
Are these all the pallets
of tobacco you're selling?

00:11:38.948 --> 00:11:40.408
No, certainly not.

00:11:40.908 --> 00:11:43.160
We keep the stock
worthy of guests elsewhere.

00:11:43.244 --> 00:11:45.329
These shipments
were too damp to sell here,

00:11:45.413 --> 00:11:46.539
so we set them aside.

00:11:46.622 --> 00:11:48.332
We'll send these to Hwaseong instead.

00:11:49.333 --> 00:11:50.584
Hwaseong?

00:11:50.668 --> 00:11:53.796
His Majesty is carrying out
some great project in that district.

00:11:53.879 --> 00:11:55.881
Workers from all across the land
have gathered there.

00:11:55.965 --> 00:12:00.094
And what do workers do when they gather,
but smoke tobacco merrily?

00:12:00.177 --> 00:12:01.846
Oh, how can I put it better?

00:12:01.929 --> 00:12:03.305
Kill two birds with one stone.

00:12:03.389 --> 00:12:05.099
Kill a bird with stones.

00:12:07.601 --> 00:12:10.146
Madam, allow me to escort you inside here.

00:12:10.229 --> 00:12:12.982
Yes, madam.
Do follow us to the inner quarters.

00:12:25.953 --> 00:12:26.996
I knew it.

00:12:27.079 --> 00:12:30.541
Since you recognize it,
I'm glad I spent all that money.

00:12:30.624 --> 00:12:32.960
I can scarcely contain my joy.

00:12:33.043 --> 00:12:35.880
A genuine Saimdang
grass-and-insect painting.

00:12:35.963 --> 00:12:38.007
Is it not truly beautiful?

00:12:42.803 --> 00:12:43.804
Uh, madam.

00:12:43.888 --> 00:12:45.306
As you enjoy these things,

00:12:45.389 --> 00:12:47.725
I have something else
that may be of interest.

00:12:47.808 --> 00:12:50.603
If you like,
I will take you to it at once.

00:13:07.203 --> 00:13:08.204
My word.

00:13:09.413 --> 00:13:11.624
You have an original Master Danwon?

00:13:11.707 --> 00:13:13.918
Yes, we certainly do.

00:13:14.001 --> 00:13:16.545
You have no idea how many people told me

00:13:16.629 --> 00:13:19.173
how knowledgeable you are
in matters of the arts,

00:13:19.256 --> 00:13:23.344
but for a novice such as I,
your keen insight is truly overwhelming.

00:13:27.348 --> 00:13:29.600
Is she not breathtaking in person?

00:13:31.519 --> 00:13:32.520
No?

00:13:39.026 --> 00:13:40.319
-Huh.
-Your thoughts, sir?

00:13:46.158 --> 00:13:47.409
Hmm.

00:13:52.122 --> 00:13:56.377
My lady, bearing a child
with this girl will be difficult.

00:14:00.089 --> 00:14:01.882
-You have done well.
-Yes, my lady.

00:14:03.425 --> 00:14:06.178
What on earth are you talking about?

00:14:06.262 --> 00:14:10.099
What a lovely house you have,
it's decorated with exceeding taste.

00:14:10.182 --> 00:14:11.267
Yes.

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:14.019
You have not simply displayed
your precious items,

00:14:14.103 --> 00:14:17.606
but used them to create harmonious
splendor which delights the eye.

00:14:18.274 --> 00:14:20.067
I find it most enjoyable.

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:21.694
Yes. Well…

00:14:22.194 --> 00:14:24.405
A humble novice such as myself cannot rest

00:14:24.488 --> 00:14:26.866
until she gets her hands
on something of value.

00:14:28.075 --> 00:14:29.535
Would you like one of them?

00:14:29.618 --> 00:14:31.871
Please, take any painting
you wish as a gift.

00:14:31.954 --> 00:14:33.998
I can even summon Master Danwon himself.

00:14:35.958 --> 00:14:38.168
Would that it were a suitable match,

00:14:38.878 --> 00:14:41.755
but alas, it seems it was not meant to be.

00:14:42.965 --> 00:14:45.676
I brought the refreshments
you asked for, Mother!

00:14:52.349 --> 00:14:56.729
Uh, we made fresh juak.
Please enjoy them, madam.

00:14:59.273 --> 00:15:01.233
Oh… uh…

00:15:01.317 --> 00:15:03.903
What's wrong? They're really tasty.

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:08.240
What?

00:15:09.074 --> 00:15:10.075
What?

00:15:11.118 --> 00:15:12.536
Damn you, you quack.

00:15:16.665 --> 00:15:17.666
Hmm.

00:15:20.419 --> 00:15:21.462
Mmm.

00:15:22.546 --> 00:15:24.006
They're really good.

00:15:25.925 --> 00:15:27.426
Hmm.

00:15:35.851 --> 00:15:40.022
I will move here.
That's my final decision.

00:15:40.773 --> 00:15:42.107
What do you think of that?

00:15:46.195 --> 00:15:48.364
Hmm?

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:02.211
Let's see.

00:16:03.462 --> 00:16:04.546
Mm-hmm.

00:16:08.717 --> 00:16:11.303
He made the most wonderful move just now.

00:16:11.387 --> 00:16:14.598
I guess he fell asleep
before my turn was over.

00:16:15.224 --> 00:16:19.436
Mark my words, he will rise higher
than anyone in our house.

00:16:19.937 --> 00:16:22.773
He's been staying with us for six days.

00:16:23.399 --> 00:16:26.276
Shouldn't your great-nephew
return to his home now?

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.654
What harm is there if he stays, hmm?

00:16:28.737 --> 00:16:31.323
That way, when he's gone,
we won't miss him as much.

00:16:32.324 --> 00:16:34.243
You truly rate his worth that high?

00:16:36.912 --> 00:16:39.248
Is he not extraordinary?

00:16:39.331 --> 00:16:42.751
Just last year, he would throw the stones
all over the chamber.

00:16:42.835 --> 00:16:47.172
But now, he has become a worthy opponent.

00:17:05.315 --> 00:17:08.277
All right.

00:17:12.823 --> 00:17:13.824
Your arms.

00:17:19.163 --> 00:17:21.665
Simply lovely, truly.

00:17:21.749 --> 00:17:24.543
When you go, this is what you must do.

00:17:25.294 --> 00:17:27.504
Stand someplace
where the lord will notice.

00:17:27.588 --> 00:17:30.716
Then say to him, "I have brought
a gift for your lady wife."

00:17:30.799 --> 00:17:34.762
Then you give him a look like this, "Ooh."

00:17:34.845 --> 00:17:36.930
Show me you can do it.

00:17:37.014 --> 00:17:41.602
Go on. That's it. Like…

00:17:42.186 --> 00:17:43.771
Like this?

00:17:43.854 --> 00:17:47.066
That's it! Exactly!

00:18:40.869 --> 00:18:41.870
Hmm?

00:19:04.476 --> 00:19:08.605
Uh, hello, my dear. And you are?

00:19:09.606 --> 00:19:12.568
Good day, my lord.

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:34.381
Oh.

00:19:36.425 --> 00:19:39.178
My lady. I found this, um…

00:19:55.611 --> 00:19:57.821
My mother bid me to come here with this.

00:19:58.405 --> 00:20:01.033
She said it must be delivered
to you today,

00:20:01.116 --> 00:20:03.285
so I came here as soon as I could.

00:20:06.872 --> 00:20:10.959
The way you're soaked in the rain,
it's quite bold, my dear.

00:20:14.755 --> 00:20:17.925
Your mother personally bid you
to come to me in the rain,

00:20:18.634 --> 00:20:20.510
with no jangot to cover yourself?

00:20:23.305 --> 00:20:24.681
Come inside and get warm.

00:20:24.765 --> 00:20:26.642
You will return when the sun has risen.

00:20:27.142 --> 00:20:31.396
You tell your mother
that I hold her wisdom in high regard,

00:20:32.648 --> 00:20:34.233
but there are lines she mustn't cross.

00:20:35.275 --> 00:20:38.737
Gye-hwa, bring something for her
to change into and some hot water.

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:39.947
Yes, madam.

00:20:50.582 --> 00:20:54.127
What a vulgar family.

00:20:55.087 --> 00:20:57.506
To waste a young girl's health
on a meager gift.

00:20:58.966 --> 00:21:01.426
If the day passes smoothly,
there's no cause for concern.

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:03.679
It troubles me
to see a young girl stricken.

00:21:03.762 --> 00:21:05.555
Especially one who came as a guest.

00:21:06.098 --> 00:21:07.516
Prepare some medicine as well.

00:21:07.599 --> 00:21:09.017
At once, my lord.

00:21:09.101 --> 00:21:10.602
Has she eaten anything today?

00:21:10.686 --> 00:21:14.398
Yes, my lord. We prepared a porridge
for the girl, as madam instructed.

00:21:14.481 --> 00:21:16.608
You feed mere porridge to a sickly girl?

00:21:19.319 --> 00:21:21.196
-Here, take this a moment.
-Yes, my lord.

00:21:22.614 --> 00:21:23.615
Oh, dear.

00:21:23.699 --> 00:21:26.326
My humble thanks to His Lordship.

00:21:33.583 --> 00:21:35.669
Pick only those that are without blemish.

00:21:37.504 --> 00:21:39.006
Mind the pathway.

00:22:07.409 --> 00:22:09.911
See there?
That patch of ground has sunk again.

00:22:11.246 --> 00:22:13.290
-I see it now.
-Spray some water on it at once.

00:22:31.183 --> 00:22:34.728
Madam, it is I, Gye-hwa.
Permission to enter?

00:22:41.610 --> 00:22:43.278
And what could that be?

00:22:43.362 --> 00:22:46.698
It's from the Lady of the First Rank
in the Left State Councilor's household.

00:22:47.574 --> 00:22:48.992
It is a velvet antler.

00:22:54.414 --> 00:22:55.415
Hmm.

00:22:55.499 --> 00:22:59.419
It would appear by this,
the lady has something to say to me.

00:23:01.046 --> 00:23:03.256
Find something fitting to send in return.

00:23:03.757 --> 00:23:05.926
If she wishes to see me, I shall oblige.

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:24.069
It's been too long since you last called.

00:23:24.152 --> 00:23:26.655
To tell the truth,
I've been terribly lonesome here.

00:23:26.738 --> 00:23:30.283
My sincerest apologies.
I should not have delayed.

00:23:31.034 --> 00:23:32.911
I hope all is well in your household.

00:23:32.994 --> 00:23:33.995
In mine, yes.

00:23:34.830 --> 00:23:37.958
It would seem that your house
is where the disorder lies.

00:23:39.042 --> 00:23:40.710
Really, my dear,

00:23:40.794 --> 00:23:44.297
it seems to me that
a man's heart beats in your womanly chest.

00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:51.179
You would personally
select Lord Yoo's concubine?

00:23:53.473 --> 00:23:55.058
Ah.

00:23:55.142 --> 00:23:56.893
You know as well as I,

00:23:56.977 --> 00:23:59.646
that Bukchon's walls
are built lower than most.

00:24:00.897 --> 00:24:04.860
Tell me, when shall you bring her in?

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:07.362
I am still looking for her.

00:24:08.155 --> 00:24:10.282
One cannot bring just any girl in.

00:24:10.365 --> 00:24:12.242
There are many things to consider.

00:24:13.952 --> 00:24:14.953
Hmm.

00:24:18.915 --> 00:24:23.170
Recently, your husband sent mine a gift.

00:24:23.253 --> 00:24:27.174
It was a considerable amount of tobacco
of the highest quality.

00:24:28.717 --> 00:24:32.387
But I thought the Lord Councilor
had left such ways behind.

00:24:36.266 --> 00:24:37.392
Oh, my.

00:24:38.602 --> 00:24:40.937
Has this news really passed you by?

00:24:42.147 --> 00:24:44.900
Whatever could you mean?

00:24:44.983 --> 00:24:48.904
The concubine,
has she not already been selected?

00:24:50.739 --> 00:24:54.201
Where else could this high-quality tobacco
have come from then?

00:24:55.243 --> 00:24:57.537
Haryanggyo is the only answer.

00:24:58.622 --> 00:25:00.207
It seems that Lord Yoo,

00:25:00.957 --> 00:25:05.128
has already developed quite a taste
for the merchandise of that little shop.

00:25:07.506 --> 00:25:09.382
Was that not what you were planning?

00:25:09.966 --> 00:25:13.178
Is that not why you took that girl
as his concubine?

00:25:17.057 --> 00:25:20.018
-Make way, make way!
-Get those boxes and move them.

00:25:21.478 --> 00:25:24.105
My word, what is all that commotion?

00:25:24.189 --> 00:25:26.733
Oh, my goodness. Look at that.

00:25:26.816 --> 00:25:28.235
If you didn't know better,

00:25:28.318 --> 00:25:32.697
one might think they were wedding gifts
for a family with an upcoming marriage.

00:25:36.493 --> 00:25:39.287
I suppose I'd be grateful
for a nobleman's seed too.

00:25:39.371 --> 00:25:41.831
-Put the crops on that side.
-All these marvelous objects.

00:25:41.915 --> 00:25:43.917
-Inside that box?
-Sell my daughter for less.

00:25:44.000 --> 00:25:45.293
Hush! What if madam hears you?

00:25:46.127 --> 00:25:47.671
The lady's coming out.

00:25:51.967 --> 00:25:54.427
Pallets over to the left side,
parcels to the right.

00:25:54.511 --> 00:25:56.263
-Hey, be careful.
-Put your back into it!

00:25:56.346 --> 00:25:57.347
Push, man!

00:25:57.430 --> 00:25:59.307
Oh, madam, right this way.

00:25:59.391 --> 00:26:00.725
Boxes this way!

00:26:03.937 --> 00:26:05.605
Be careful with that.

00:26:06.815 --> 00:26:08.567
Whoa, this item is precious!

00:26:10.819 --> 00:26:14.239
Madam. Madam, madam.

00:26:15.824 --> 00:26:18.868
I'm certain I told you
not to come anywhere near us.

00:26:21.121 --> 00:26:22.414
What is the meaning of this?

00:26:22.497 --> 00:26:23.832
Please excuse me, madam.

00:26:24.332 --> 00:26:25.667
I received your message,

00:26:25.750 --> 00:26:29.087
but ignorant wench that I am,
I felt I had no choice but to do this.

00:26:29.588 --> 00:26:32.924
-That's why I came to see you.
-I have no reason to accept these,

00:26:33.633 --> 00:26:35.176
so take them back at once.

00:26:40.807 --> 00:26:42.601
Madam!

00:26:43.184 --> 00:26:44.477
-Gye-hwa, come.
-Yes, ma'am.

00:26:44.561 --> 00:26:45.687
Turn this lady out of doors.

00:26:46.980 --> 00:26:48.565
-Madam!
-This way.

00:26:48.648 --> 00:26:52.277
I see you're displeased.
I understand that at least.

00:26:52.777 --> 00:26:56.656
How could it be otherwise?
We are both but women.

00:27:00.452 --> 00:27:01.453
What?

00:27:01.536 --> 00:27:04.247
Madam, a lowborn wench like I,

00:27:04.331 --> 00:27:08.084
shall never forget what you have done
by showing favor to my girl.

00:27:08.960 --> 00:27:11.046
I am sure that without your leave,

00:27:11.129 --> 00:27:14.007
His Lordship
would never have come to visit me,

00:27:14.090 --> 00:27:16.968
and tell me he'd chosen my So-ok himself.

00:27:22.682 --> 00:27:25.602
One thing,
is there a date you'd like to take her in?

00:27:25.685 --> 00:27:30.231
I will make sure to teach her properly
by then and send her to you straight away.

00:27:31.650 --> 00:27:33.485
I am ever so grateful, madam.

00:27:52.921 --> 00:27:56.758
Hmm, let's see. Then we go like this.

00:27:58.259 --> 00:27:59.302
Let me try now.

00:27:59.386 --> 00:28:02.847
-Like this.
-Oh, please, my lord, stop moving!

00:28:02.931 --> 00:28:05.850
All right. All right,
all right, all right. Try it like this.

00:28:05.934 --> 00:28:09.771
Oh.

00:28:13.066 --> 00:28:15.026
-Please make it again.
-Yes, of course.

00:28:15.819 --> 00:28:19.614
Now, do try your best this time, hmm?
Here.

00:28:27.205 --> 00:28:28.498
Let's see.

00:28:43.388 --> 00:28:46.224
The mistress of the tobacco shop
was here earlier.

00:28:49.102 --> 00:28:51.771
It seems that vulgar woman
came by unannounced.

00:28:52.564 --> 00:28:54.774
You must have been quite surprised, dear.

00:28:55.358 --> 00:28:56.359
That girl.

00:28:57.819 --> 00:28:59.738
Do you find her to your liking?

00:29:06.536 --> 00:29:07.537
My lady,

00:29:08.621 --> 00:29:10.957
I told you many times it was unnecessary,

00:29:11.040 --> 00:29:13.001
but you would not be dissuaded.

00:29:13.084 --> 00:29:16.212
I'm truly sorry for making you
bear this burden alone.

00:29:16.713 --> 00:29:19.007
It's not a position of great importance.

00:29:19.090 --> 00:29:21.468
I thought someone like her would do well.

00:29:49.120 --> 00:29:53.291
Madam, a gift has arrived from
the Chief Royal Secretary's residence.

00:29:53.875 --> 00:29:59.088
And ladies from other various houses
have also sent some small gift boxes.

00:29:59.172 --> 00:30:00.757
Shall I bring them in together?

00:30:19.192 --> 00:30:21.027
Oh, that is too much.

00:30:21.736 --> 00:30:24.781
I was visiting
with my sixth cousin's maternal aunt.

00:30:25.907 --> 00:30:27.826
She's close with the tobacco shop woman,

00:30:27.909 --> 00:30:30.620
and she told me that the second daughter

00:30:31.120 --> 00:30:34.165
has already gone
to visit the lord in the night.

00:30:34.249 --> 00:30:35.875
Let's just say, she wasn't so innocent.

00:30:35.959 --> 00:30:37.877
-Oh my, that indecent girl!
-Good heavens.

00:30:37.961 --> 00:30:40.505
Some say they've even heard
the sound of a baby crying

00:30:40.588 --> 00:30:42.048
from the Master of Rites' quarters.

00:30:42.131 --> 00:30:44.592
With child before me?
No girl is that fast.

00:30:48.054 --> 00:30:49.347
According to what I heard,

00:30:49.430 --> 00:30:53.017
it's the girl's mother who the lord
has been having indecent relations with.

00:30:53.101 --> 00:30:55.395
Is that so?

00:30:55.478 --> 00:30:56.729
Surely not.

00:30:57.564 --> 00:30:59.941
The Minister would not
involve himself with that wench.

00:31:00.024 --> 00:31:03.695
Whatever the case may be,
they say the girl was with child already.

00:31:03.778 --> 00:31:08.241
To avoid a scandal, Lady Cho is making
a pretense of taking in a concubine,

00:31:08.324 --> 00:31:09.701
to appear generous.

00:31:10.285 --> 00:31:13.663
To think of how loftily she held herself.

00:31:13.746 --> 00:31:17.125
Come to think of it, it's been some time
since we sent her gifts.

00:31:17.208 --> 00:31:18.418
Yet she still hasn't--

00:31:19.002 --> 00:31:20.545
Madam.

00:31:21.671 --> 00:31:25.800
I could hear your peals of laughter
all the way from my inner chambers.

00:31:26.467 --> 00:31:29.262
It seems you were sharing an amusing tale.

00:31:29.345 --> 00:31:32.807
Please do share it with me as well.
I am most curious.

00:31:32.891 --> 00:31:36.102
It had been so long since I heard
from you, I wondered if you would come.

00:31:37.520 --> 00:31:39.731
Mmm. The fragrance is quite lovely here.

00:31:39.814 --> 00:31:43.067
Yes, indeed, as is the weather.

00:31:52.827 --> 00:31:54.078
Aren't I pretty?

00:31:54.579 --> 00:31:56.664
I'm getting better. Look.

00:31:57.790 --> 00:32:00.084
One, two…

00:32:04.213 --> 00:32:05.214
Look, Mal-ttong!

00:32:18.311 --> 00:32:19.771
You should try.

00:32:41.626 --> 00:32:42.627
Oh!

00:32:44.921 --> 00:32:47.882
I noticed that spring
had arrived in full this morning.

00:32:47.966 --> 00:32:50.093
I wanted to bring some of it to you.

00:32:52.387 --> 00:32:56.432
I hope you slept soundly last night,
uh, madam.

00:33:16.369 --> 00:33:17.370
Cho-hui.

00:33:23.001 --> 00:33:24.585
What flower is that?

00:33:25.503 --> 00:33:26.504
It's lovely.

00:33:32.010 --> 00:33:33.803
What lovely petals.

00:33:34.387 --> 00:33:35.805
Do you like them as well?

00:33:39.475 --> 00:33:41.811
Perhaps they aren't
so beautiful after all,

00:33:42.395 --> 00:33:44.230
for yours is the lovelier spring.

00:33:45.648 --> 00:33:46.983
How do you do that, madam?

00:33:47.567 --> 00:33:49.068
Sound so smart when you talk?

00:33:51.070 --> 00:33:53.990
Your eyes fill with tears
surprisingly quickly.

00:33:56.784 --> 00:33:59.704
Well, your heart is young still.

00:34:06.461 --> 00:34:09.172
You brought the flower,
you may leave me now.

00:34:10.757 --> 00:34:11.758
Yes.

00:34:14.010 --> 00:34:16.429
Thank you so much for your time, my lady.

00:34:35.656 --> 00:34:36.699
Mun-heul.

00:34:37.575 --> 00:34:39.619
This is the pen name I gave myself.

00:34:40.495 --> 00:34:43.790
I hope, like the moon
that rises highest in the night sky,

00:34:43.873 --> 00:34:46.918
that my writings
will at least flourish in darkness.

00:34:47.001 --> 00:34:50.588
Even if in my lifetime,
they never see the light of day.

00:34:52.215 --> 00:34:56.385
That is why it is such comfort to me
that I can share myself with you.

00:34:56.886 --> 00:34:59.055
From now on, I will write to you
with my pen name.

00:35:00.306 --> 00:35:01.474
Speaking of which,

00:35:02.141 --> 00:35:06.062
if you are so inclined,
would you use the pen name, Cho-hui?

00:35:06.729 --> 00:35:08.773
It's Nanseolheon's real name.

00:35:10.566 --> 00:35:12.443
On my way back from the village school,

00:35:12.527 --> 00:35:16.155
a flower petal fell,
and landed softly in my hand.

00:35:17.615 --> 00:35:21.619
It felt as though fate itself had decreed
it should come directly to me.

00:35:22.453 --> 00:35:24.330
I held it in my hand and brought it home.

00:35:26.207 --> 00:35:28.209
I'm entrusting my fate to you.

00:35:28.835 --> 00:35:29.961
Please do not lose it.

00:36:13.212 --> 00:36:14.297
My lord.

00:36:17.592 --> 00:36:18.759
You have a letter!

00:36:22.763 --> 00:36:23.973
Oh my…

00:36:24.056 --> 00:36:25.391
I'll leave it here.

00:36:25.474 --> 00:36:27.185
-How does it taste?
-Mmm.

00:36:34.817 --> 00:36:39.530
I heard the Chief State Councilor's wife
has a pipe no less than nine cheok long.

00:36:39.614 --> 00:36:42.909
That is what their steward said.
The pipe is so long

00:36:42.992 --> 00:36:46.120
that her maidservant had to go
to the next room to light it.

00:36:47.914 --> 00:36:49.999
"Dearest? Have you put it in yet?"

00:36:50.082 --> 00:36:52.960
"Of course! You must suck harder, madam!"

00:36:53.044 --> 00:36:55.588
-That's very good.
-Oh, my lord.

00:36:55.671 --> 00:36:57.673
MUN-HEUL

00:37:02.845 --> 00:37:05.014
Excellent.

00:37:05.097 --> 00:37:06.390
-Is that so?
-Yes.

00:37:06.474 --> 00:37:08.601
-Mine tastes somewhat sour.
-Oh?

00:37:08.684 --> 00:37:10.937
There's a note of tartness in the throat.

00:37:11.020 --> 00:37:13.147
-Ah, the throat, huh?
-Mmm.

00:37:13.814 --> 00:37:16.984
Oh. No, it needs more.

00:37:17.068 --> 00:37:18.569
Does that tartness

00:37:19.570 --> 00:37:22.573
give you a sense of pleasure
as you inhale it?

00:37:23.491 --> 00:37:26.160
-My! That sounds like my first time.
-Or does it…

00:37:29.205 --> 00:37:31.207
I want to smoke that.

00:37:31.290 --> 00:37:33.542
I would give anything
to feel that way again.

00:37:33.626 --> 00:37:36.212
Oh, it's from Samdeungcho.

00:37:37.088 --> 00:37:39.340
I knew the men from there were a bit tart.

00:37:39.423 --> 00:37:40.633
Be quiet.

00:37:42.843 --> 00:37:44.512
-Get out now.
-What was that?

00:37:55.064 --> 00:37:56.649
Cho-hui!

00:38:10.746 --> 00:38:12.957
MUN-HEUL

00:38:25.052 --> 00:38:26.721
What's changed, young master?

00:38:26.804 --> 00:38:29.807
You never used to eat
things like this before.

00:38:33.519 --> 00:38:36.105
To my cousin, Cho Won.

00:38:38.691 --> 00:38:42.361
Spring has already begun
to gently ripple through Bukchon,

00:38:43.070 --> 00:38:45.531
and it would appear
through my heart as well,

00:38:45.614 --> 00:38:48.576
for I find, I miss you more than ever.

00:38:51.120 --> 00:38:52.955
Have you been well all these years?

00:39:10.348 --> 00:39:12.308
I must see you, dear cousin.

00:39:12.975 --> 00:39:16.187
So please, come to see me with all haste.

00:39:17.897 --> 00:39:20.316
I have been enduring all this time

00:39:21.150 --> 00:39:23.444
and can no longer bear the longing.

00:39:25.279 --> 00:39:27.406
Be careful not to step on the flowers.

00:39:28.741 --> 00:39:30.284
Bring some more!

00:39:30.368 --> 00:39:33.579
Madam, Lord Cho Won is
on his way to Hanyang.

00:40:22.962 --> 00:40:24.213
Look at everyone.

00:40:24.296 --> 00:40:25.506
It's the entire kingdom.

00:40:27.133 --> 00:40:29.718
-I've got 15 on that guy!
-Oh, yes, lift him up

00:40:29.802 --> 00:40:32.388
-Throw him down, like that!
-He's down! He's down!

00:40:32.471 --> 00:40:36.767
Hey, hey, so you're telling me
You're going to bet some money? Huh?

00:40:36.851 --> 00:40:39.395
The palanquins all line up

00:40:39.478 --> 00:40:42.022
-Snip, snip, scissors are cutting yeot
-Sticky sweet yeot for sale!

00:40:42.106 --> 00:40:43.357
It is so sweet, it is to die for

00:40:43.441 --> 00:40:45.276
-You could die eating it
-Come on, who wants some yeot?

00:40:45.359 --> 00:40:47.069
-And you might never know
-I want some.

00:40:47.153 --> 00:40:49.697
-Please, Mom? I want some.
-Hanyang's white yeot

00:40:49.780 --> 00:40:51.365
Where are you going in such a hurry?

00:40:51.449 --> 00:40:53.492
-Spreading in the air
-Why don't you and I have a drink?

00:40:53.576 --> 00:40:56.036
-The scent of plum blossom
-You know where to find us.

00:40:56.120 --> 00:41:00.374
Which fellow is it today?
Huh? Which one?

00:41:00.458 --> 00:41:02.001
Look at this man, look at that man

00:41:02.084 --> 00:41:03.919
They're coming here
Swarming after profit

00:41:04.003 --> 00:41:07.339
Then they go their separate ways

00:41:07.423 --> 00:41:12.845
It's Hanyang, the walled city

00:41:13.387 --> 00:41:15.264
Cross Gwangtong Bridge to the south

00:41:15.347 --> 00:41:16.891
Then you arrive in Namchon

00:41:16.974 --> 00:41:19.018
Where you'll find
Most of the common people live

00:41:20.186 --> 00:41:21.395
If you cross to the north

00:41:21.479 --> 00:41:23.856
You arrive in Bukchon and its nobility

00:41:23.939 --> 00:41:27.735
Bukchon is such a sight
It's just wonderful!

00:41:27.818 --> 00:41:30.321
Make way, move aside! Please, move aside!

00:41:30.821 --> 00:41:34.241
Move! Stand aside!

00:41:35.159 --> 00:41:37.036
Out of the way at once!

00:41:38.704 --> 00:41:40.831
Make way at once!

00:41:40.915 --> 00:41:46.462
Palanquin bearers
Of high-ranking officials

00:41:46.545 --> 00:41:50.257
Wild animals even hide away

00:41:50.341 --> 00:41:52.968
And birds do fold their wings

00:41:53.052 --> 00:41:56.180
Within the walls of Hanyang Fortress

00:41:56.263 --> 00:42:00.100
It's unrivaled

00:42:00.184 --> 00:42:02.061
Don't you think? Huh?

00:42:02.144 --> 00:42:05.231
Whether it is true or not

00:42:05.898 --> 00:42:08.359
Bukchon

00:42:25.084 --> 00:42:27.628
I will escort you
to the inner chamber, my lord.

00:42:55.489 --> 00:42:58.826
Madam, Lord Cho Won has arrived.

00:43:06.750 --> 00:43:08.294
You may enter.

00:43:32.610 --> 00:43:36.530
It seems the journey to Hanyang
has been quite a lengthy one for you.

00:43:37.364 --> 00:43:40.576
I needed time to decide
whether I should even come to this place.

00:43:41.201 --> 00:43:44.246
This is my first visit,
and I did not know the way.

00:43:44.997 --> 00:43:46.373
Have you been waiting long?

00:43:53.130 --> 00:43:54.840
Have you been well, my lady?

00:43:56.967 --> 00:43:59.094
The moon waxes and wanes.

00:44:00.262 --> 00:44:03.515
The flowers bloom in abundance
with every change of season.

00:44:04.224 --> 00:44:05.684
So have I been…

00:44:06.977 --> 00:44:08.145
very well indeed.

00:44:08.812 --> 00:44:10.147
You're very beautiful

00:44:11.732 --> 00:44:12.733
as always.

00:44:17.738 --> 00:44:21.325
In truth, I have something
I wish to ask of you,

00:44:21.825 --> 00:44:23.202
my dearest cousin.

00:44:24.078 --> 00:44:25.371
A wish, you say?

00:44:32.169 --> 00:44:33.796
What is this wish

00:44:33.879 --> 00:44:37.049
that made you write to me
after such a long silence?

00:44:38.425 --> 00:44:40.427
We have decided to take a concubine.

00:44:43.430 --> 00:44:46.392
Which brings me to the thing
I would ask of you.

00:44:49.895 --> 00:44:51.647
The girl's name is So-ok.

00:44:52.481 --> 00:44:55.526
I want you to put a child
in her belly, yourself.

00:44:58.112 --> 00:44:59.113
What?

00:45:01.907 --> 00:45:03.242
If I refuse…

00:45:05.911 --> 00:45:07.955
will today be the last time I see you?

00:45:09.081 --> 00:45:11.583
You know I will always be by your side.

00:45:12.251 --> 00:45:15.087
But you said yourself
that this was a place

00:45:15.170 --> 00:45:16.880
where you had better not come.

00:45:16.964 --> 00:45:17.965
Is that so?

00:45:18.048 --> 00:45:19.508
I've heard that you pass your time

00:45:19.591 --> 00:45:22.386
by picking all the beautiful flowers
outside of Hanyang.

00:45:23.721 --> 00:45:27.307
So why don't you show me
the man you've become, dear cousin?

00:45:27.391 --> 00:45:28.934
Show me your famed expertise.

00:45:29.017 --> 00:45:32.479
You want me to bed a young girl
I could woo with a glance?

00:45:33.856 --> 00:45:36.108
Sounds like a waste of my talent.

00:45:37.526 --> 00:45:39.778
At that age, a strong wind
is enough to sweep them away.

00:45:39.862 --> 00:45:43.615
Which is why it should be simple enough
for you to accomplish.

00:45:53.709 --> 00:45:56.462
Why haven't you sired
a child of your own then?

00:45:58.505 --> 00:46:01.091
Wait. Is it my brother-in-law?

00:46:04.136 --> 00:46:05.971
Certainly not.

00:46:06.972 --> 00:46:09.558
How could there be any fault
with my husband?

00:46:09.641 --> 00:46:12.060
Rather, it is due to my lack of virtue.

00:46:13.687 --> 00:46:15.481
I was taught propriety.

00:46:16.523 --> 00:46:18.901
A lady always knows to hold her tongue,

00:46:18.984 --> 00:46:22.112
and do her best
to support her husband in silence.

00:46:24.239 --> 00:46:25.365
Is that right?

00:46:26.492 --> 00:46:27.493
But still,

00:46:27.993 --> 00:46:30.579
why must I father this child?

00:46:33.457 --> 00:46:35.459
Because it's always been my wish…

00:46:37.961 --> 00:46:40.881
to hold a child in my arms
that has your eyes.

00:46:43.550 --> 00:46:46.303
That would be the pleasure
of my remaining years,

00:46:47.805 --> 00:46:49.932
to hold that child and know the truth.

00:46:57.773 --> 00:46:59.441
My dearest cousin…

00:47:02.277 --> 00:47:03.529
are you saying…

00:47:05.447 --> 00:47:07.533
that you still hold me in your heart?

00:47:13.914 --> 00:47:14.915
Then…

00:47:17.709 --> 00:47:19.086
you feel the same?